        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In Ganesh Trader's case (1 supra) a Full Bench of this Court observed as under:-\n\"41."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6a9c13b8dcf0441690e4f36a820702ad_12",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "We may, however, hasten to add that unless the Commissioner, Collector, Police Officer or competent Excise Officer \"has reason to believe\" that black jaggery is intended to manufacture ID liquor mere keeping and/or transporting any other ma"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b0ae5b3904a1496b82d9f46c9faa4d0f_13",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In such an event, it is always open to the accused to prove before the competent criminal Court that black jaggery was material intended not for manufacture of liquor but was intended for other purpose."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c86750d9de2e413898e70c31cac9a424_14",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The learned counsel for the petitioners have not placed before us any evidence/ material to show that black jaggery can also be used for other purposes."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "62a944a0fab844c1b5c22735c4210934_15",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Be that as it may they only submitted that black jaggery or jaggery with which they were dealing was not intended for manufacturing liquor."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0479c57ac5ca491fb4cda1c20fc1c121_16",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In W.P.No. 354 of 2001 and W.P.No. 22705 of 2000 the learned Government Pleader has placed before us the report of the chemical examiner, which shows that the material seized from the petitioners contains debris, sand and other injurious su"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "aad7a37b5579473c8b439e78648058ce_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Having regard to the provisions of Sections 13, 34 and 53 and 55 of the Excise Act, we must hold that if Commissioner, Collector, Police Officer or Excise Officer \"has reason to believe\" that black jaggery (material) is likely to be used fo"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "36aa84ec15dd4ba1ac4b0ab7c46fe83c_20",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "This Court in Athukuri Subba Rao vs. The State Of Telangana 2, while considering the judgment of the Division Bench of this Court in Deputy Commissioner of (Prohibition and Excise) v. Shobalal 3 and the judgment of the Hon'ble Apex Court in"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "82e9071f4b054ea09e6785be5d70bb12_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "We are bound by the apex ratio and are of considered opinion that in matters of excise offences, the authorities and Courts should insist strict compliance with the provisions of the Excise Act."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5ecf016534434857a09fa0c86dd08130_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "62. Therefore, in these proceedings the petitioners cannot be given any relief for release of either black jaggery or vehicles involved."
